---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Research" description="Research interests and highlights">
  <div class="research-container">
    <h1>Research</h1>
    
    <section class="research-section">
      <h2>Research Interests</h2>
      <div class="interest-grid">
        <div class="interest-card">
          <h3>🔗 Network Science & Graph Analysis</h3>
          <p>Analyzing complex networks to understand information flow, collaboration patterns, and knowledge diffusion in academic and social contexts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <h3>🔤 Natural Language Processing</h3>
          <p>Extracting insights from text data, understanding semantic relationships, and identifying patterns in scholarly discourse and social media.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <h3>🤖 Machine Learning & AI</h3>
          <p>Developing predictive models, classification algorithms, and recommendation systems for real-world applications in academic and business contexts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <h3>📊 Computational Social Science</h3>
          <p>Using computational methods to study human behavior, cultural evolution, and collective dynamics in sociotechnical systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <h3>⚠️ Misinformation & Disinformation</h3>
          <p>Investigating the spread, detection, and mitigation of false information across social networks and online platforms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <h3>📱 Social Media Analytics</h3>
          <p>Studying user behavior, information cascades, and community dynamics across social platforms like Twitter, Reddit, and others.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="research-section">
      <h2>Methodological Toolkit</h2>
      <div class="methods-grid">
        <div class="method-box">
          <h4>Network Analysis</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Graph theory and algorithms</li>
            <li>Community detection</li>
            <li>Centrality measures</li>
            <li>Diffusion models</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="method-box">
          <h4>Natural Language Processing</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Topic modeling</li>
            <li>Sentiment analysis</li>
            <li>Text classification</li>
            <li>Word embeddings & transformers</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="method-box">
          <h4>Machine Learning</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Supervised learning</li>
            <li>Unsupervised learning</li>
            <li>Deep learning</li>
            <li>Ensemble methods</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="method-box">
          <h4>Statistical Analysis</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Bayesian inference</li>
            <li>Hypothesis testing</li>
            <li>Regression analysis</li>
            <li>Time series analysis</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="research-section">
      <h2>Research Collaborations</h2>
      <p>I actively collaborate with researchers across multiple institutions, focusing on interdisciplinary approaches to understanding complex systems and information dynamics. Current research projects involve:</p>
      <ul class="collaboration-list">
        <li>Postdoctoral researchers and students at Elon University's Center for Applied Analytics and AI</li>
        <li>Faculty members at Boston University and other leading research institutions</li>
        <li>Industry partners interested in applied analytics and AI solutions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .research-container {
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .research-container h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .research-section {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .research-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .research-section p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .interest-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .interest-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .interest-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .interest-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .interest-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .methods-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .method-box {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background-color: var(--color-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .method-box h4 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .method-box ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .method-box li {
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .method-box li:before {
      content: "→";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .collaboration-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .collaboration-list li {
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .collaboration-list li:before {
      content: "○";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .research-container h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .research-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .interest-grid,
      .methods-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Page>
